# Remote screen (R-048, D-53): asked by voice, the AI opens a page the hub
# renders (remote.open); the device shows the changed areas it pulls, a tap is
# answered locally at once and by the hub after its render.
@3s      mic   speech
+0       key   ai 1200ms         # "打开网页看看今天的新闻" -> the hub calls remote.open
+17s     snap  remote-first      # the answer sheet covers the lower half; the links are above it
+0       tap   560 85 150ms      # the "next" link (held 150 ms: the touch controller may be in its slow scan)
+6s      snap  remote-next       # (taps 6 s apart: each finds the panel idle)
+0       tap   560 85 150ms      # next again
+6s      tap   100 85 150ms      # the "previous" link
+6s      end
